Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> statement
Rule 1     statement -> ID ASSIGN value
Rule 2     statement -> instruction
Rule 3     value -> NUMBER
Rule 4     value -> FLOAT
Rule 5     value -> DATE
Rule 6     value -> HOUR
Rule 7     value -> WEEKDAY
Rule 8     value -> DISHTYPE
Rule 9     value -> SENSORTYPE
Rule 10    value -> ID
Rule 11    number_or_var -> NUMBER
Rule 12    number_or_var -> ID
Rule 13    float_or_var -> FLOAT
Rule 14    float_or_var -> NUMBER
Rule 15    float_or_var -> ID
Rule 16    date_or_var -> DATE
Rule 17    date_or_var -> ID
Rule 18    hour_or_var -> HOUR
Rule 19    hour_or_var -> ID
Rule 20    dishtype_or_var -> DISHTYPE
