Rule 22    sensortype_or_var -> SENSORTYPE
Rule 23    sensortype_or_var -> ID
Rule 24    instruction -> RENT EQUIPMENT COLON number_or_var COMMA hour_or_var COMMA hour_or_var COMMA date_or_var
Rule 25    reservation_status -> ACTIVE
Rule 26    reservation_status -> COMPLETED
Rule 27    reservation_status -> CANCELED
Rule 28    instruction -> GET RESERVATIONS
Rule 29    instruction -> GET RESERVATIONS number_or_var
Rule 30    instruction -> UPDATE RESERVATIONS number_or_var reservation_status
Rule 31    instruction -> CANCEL EQUIPMENT COLON number_or_var
Rule 32    instruction -> BUY MEAL COLON dishtype_or_var COMMA date_or_var
Rule 33    instruction -> CANCEL MEAL COLON number_or_var
Rule 34    instruction -> REGISTER USER COLON STRING COMMA STRING COMMA NIF COMMA EMAIL COMMA ID COMMA PASSWORD COMMA USERTYPE
Rule 35    instruction -> REGISTER EQUIPMENT COLON ID COMMA number_or_var COMMA number_or_var COMMA number_or_var COMMA number_or_var
Rule 36    instruction -> REGISTER EQUIPMENT COLON HCID
Rule 37    instruction -> GET RESOURCES
Rule 38    instruction -> GET RESOURCES number_or_var
Rule 39    instruction -> GET RESOURCES EQUIPMENT
Rule 40    instruction -> REGISTER EQUIPMENT COLON sensortype_or_var COMMA number_or_var COMMA float_or_var
Rule 41    action -> RENT
Rule 42    action -> BUY
Rule 43    action -> REGISTER
Rule 44    action -> CANCEL

